with \code{C + 2} degrees of freedom and scale \verb{(1e-4 I)^-1} for the period
and cohort precisions of \code{C} fields, as in the branch.

\strong{Sampler and convergence} as \code{\link[=apc_bayes]{apc_bayes()}} with \code{coherent = TRUE}: four
chains, the Gelman-Rubin statistic of the precisions of the age effects,
the diagonals of the Wishart precisions, the last period effect and the
level of every field in the last year.
